       "type": "array"
      },
      {
       "items": {
        "items": {
         "type": "integer"
        },
        "maxItems": 4,
        "minItems": 4,
        "type": "array"
       },
       "maxItems": 4,
       "minItems": 4,
       "type": "array"
      }
     ],
     "description": "A homogeneous matrix stored as a list of rows, with the same layout as an affine matrix: 3x3 for a 2D rotation, 4x4 for a 3D rotation. Each row and each column of the upper-left block has exactly one nonzero entry, 1 or -1, and the block has determinant +1. The last column and the bottom row are both [0, 0, 1] in 2D or [0, 0, 0, 1] in 3D, so there is no translation.",
